#: ../../entities/university-fudan.rst:1
msgid "Fudan University"
msgstr "Universidad de Fudan"

#: ../../entities/university-fudan.rst:4
msgid "复旦大学"
msgstr "复旦大学"

#: ../../entities/university-fudan.rst:6
msgid "University | Yangpu | Research checked 2026-11-04"
msgstr "Universidad | Distrito de Yangpu | Investigación verificada el 2026-11-04"

#: ../../entities/university-fudan.rst:8
msgid "Ministry of Education institution code: 4131010246."
msgstr "Código institucional del Ministerio de Educación (MOE): 4131010246."

#: ../../entities/university-fudan.rst:10
msgid ""
"Institutional entry in the June 2026 Ministry of Education register. "
"Suggested collaboration themes: Software AI, chips, AI for Science. These "
"themes are editorial routing guidance, not a verified offer of laboratory "
"access or startup funding."
msgstr "Registro institucional en el padrón del Ministerio de Educación de junio de 2026. Temas de colaboración sugeridos: IA de software, chips, IA para la Ciencia. Estos temas constituyen una orientación editorial y no una oferta verificada de acceso a laboratorios o financiación para startups."

#: ../../entities/university-fudan.rst:12
msgid ""
"`Evidence S074 <https://www.fudan.edu.cn/en/Contact_931/list.htm>`_. "
"Contact."
msgstr "`Evidencia S074 <https://www.fudan.edu.cn/en/Contact_931/list.htm>`_. Contact."

#: ../../entities/university-fudan.rst:14
msgid ""
"`Evidence S075 <https://ist.fudan.edu.cn/Data/View/3276>`_. 技术转移中心 - "
"部门设置（联系方式） - 复旦大学科学技术研究院."
msgstr "`Evidencia S075 <https://ist.fudan.edu.cn/Data/View/3276>`_. 技术转移中心 - 部门设置（联系方式） - 复旦大学科学技术研究院."

#: ../../entities/university-fudan.rst:16
msgid ""
